# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of what line
# endings get introduced by editing from Windows vs WSL on this NTFS
# checkout. See homelab README "Pinned conventions" for why this matters:
# CRLF churn on every file touched from Windows was drowning real diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
